{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地男神楊洋年前夥拍迪麗熱巴主演《你是我的榮耀》上演女明星與科研人員的甜蜜戲碼，令二人事業再創高峯，近日楊洋宣布與陳都靈合演新作《等風熱吻你》，情節背景與《你》劇相若，只是楊洋由科研人員「變身」法醫，與「頂流演員」陳都靈展開戀愛故事。</p><p>劇組同</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.602527+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.146780+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.146780+00:00","content_hash":"85abd77baad3f7e5ac00dc3528abb7882551ce3b2f21f62dc4494d723ec4d4a9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}